/waypointd
/waypointd-arm64
*.deb
dist/

# Build-time upstream clones (built by waypoint-stack, never vendored here)
/MMDVMHost/
/ircDDBGateway/

# CustomPiOS build residue (image/tests/build-local.sh)
image/src/build.log
image/src/workspace-*/
image/src/image-*/
/hostseed
/.wrangler/

# Claude Code's scratch worktrees. These are working copies of THIS repository —
# committing one records a gitlink to a commit that exists only in somebody's
# local clone, which is how .claude/worktrees/issue-33-closeout got in (2eef761)
# and dangled until it was removed. Editor/agent state is not repository state.
#
# Scoped to worktrees/ rather than all of .claude/ on purpose: shared agent
# config (settings.json, agents, skills) is a reasonable thing to commit later,
# and a blanket ignore would silently swallow it.
/.claude/worktrees/

# Raw bench captures (tools/dmrdcapture/bench-capture.sh writes here). The pcaps
# are working material: a fixture is committed to internal/*/testdata/ only after
# it has been trimmed and given a header saying how it was taken and what was
# sanitized. A stray multi-megabyte pcap of live traffic is neither.
/capture/
